				Time="2011-07-22T11:02:37" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>バリアが　解除された！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T09:19:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
